## 2025.286 1.6.11

### Added

-   Support to install packages from self hosted file
    repository. To read the packages from **/tmp/repo**
    use the following configuration settings:

    ```console
base_url = file:///tmp/repo
db_url = file:///tmp/repo
    ```

    The directory **/tmp/repo** must contain the core.db
    file and the module directories.
    You can download the core.db from
    [https://data.gempa.de/repo/core.db](https://data.gempa.de/repo/core.db)

```text"
/tmp/repo

├── core.db
├── licenses
│   ├── xxx.crt
│   └── xxx-license.txt
└── seiscomp
    ├── 4
    ├── 5
    └── 6
        ├── debian
        ├── rhel
        │   └── 9
        │       └── x86_64
        │           ├── ...
        │           ├── seiscomp-6.9.1-rhel-9-x86_64.tar.gz
        │           ├── seiscomp-6.9.1-rhel-9-x86_64.tar.gz.dsc
        │           └── seiscomp-6.9.1-rhel-9-x86_64.tar.gz.sig
        └── ubuntu
```

-   Add file://

