## 2025.022 1.6.0

### Fixed

-   Removal of unused dependencies (pip install from configparser)

### Added

-   More logs to log/gsm.log file
-   Option to backup downloaded package files. By default this feature
    is disabled. The backup can be enabled in the gsm.conf as follows:

    ```console
    backup_package_enable = [True/False]
    backup_package_path = /home/data/gsm/backup
    ```

-   Option to clean backups

    ```console
    gsm clean backups
    ```

-   Optional package verification with gpg signature. The verification
    check can be enabled in the gsm configuration as shown below.

    ```console
    gpgverify = [True/False]
    ```

-   Option to display configuration option for the gsm.conf

    ```console
    gsm help config
    ```

-   Dependency installation of packages

