## 2020-08-19

### Added

-   Some Python package manager e.g. **pip** needs superuser rights to install
    the `psutil` package. In order that packages can be installed even an user
    has no superuser rights we ask the user if he wants to skip the running
    module check if the `psutils` package couldn't be found.

