## 2020-06-30

### Important

-   The new version requires the `humanize` Python package. See the README for
    install instructions.

### Added

-   New configuration option `install_path`. Previously, applications were
    always installed in the `seiscomp3` or `seiscomp`directory. Use this option
    to set a user-defined root path, e.g., `install_path=/home/sysop/seiscomp4`

    ```console
    /home/sysop/seiscomp4
    bin
    etc
    ...
    ```

-   Support for `jakarta-nightly` builds. At the moment nightly builds does not
    have an explicit version number so the command

    ```console
    ./gsm install seiscomp3
    ```

    installs always the latest available version without any user interaction.
    The builds does not appear in the update list either.

### Changed

-   Package installation summary shows more useful information e.g. the install
    dir.

