## 2019-12-05

### Fixed

-   Corrected typos. This change breaks existing installations. Please run the
    following commands to migrate the local package file database.

    ```console
    cd gsm/local
    find -name desc | xargs -i  sed -i 's/pgkinstallsize/pkginstallsize/g' {}
    find -name desc | xargs -i  sed -i 's/pgksize/pkgsize/g' {}
    ```

